SUMMARY:Art Adventures (Morning Session)
DESCRIPTION:In this art-inspired\, hands-on art-making class for six- to nine-year-olds\, participants will create their own artwork inspired by the art on view in the Ackland galleries. \nSpace is limited; registration required. Please email AcklandRSVP@unc.edu to register. Free for Ackland Members at the Household Level and above; $5 per child for all others.
URL:https://events.ackland.org/event/ackapl2aplackart-adventures-morning-session-6/
LOCATION:Ackland Art Museum\, 101 S. Columbia Street\, Chapel Hill\, NC\, 27514\, United States
CATEGORIES:Art Adventures,Studio Saturday
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.ackland.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/011020_Ranatza_SatKidsEventsJan20-13.jpg
END:VEVENT
